{"id":"sirvan","qid":"Q241116","category":"city","type":"oikonym","names":{"az":"Şirvan","ru":"Ширван","en":"Shirvan"},"coordinates":[48.92028,39.93194],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":"sirvan-salyan","regionSource":"wp-az","admin":[],"firstRecord":{"year":1801,"precision":"century","century":19,"bce":false,"kind":"founded","source":"wp-ru"},"period":"modern","forms":[{"form":"Zubovka","lang":"az","to":1938,"sources":["wd"]},{"form":"Зубовка","lang":"ru","to":1938,"sources":["wd","wp-ru"]},{"form":"Али-Байрамлы","lang":"ru","from":1938,"to":2008,"sources":["wd","wp-ru"]},{"form":"Əli-Bayramlı","lang":"az","from":1938,"to":2008,"sources":["wd"]},{"form":"Şirvan","lang":"az","from":2008,"current":true,"sources":["wd"]}],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Şirvan (əvvəlki adları Zubovka (1938-ci ilədək); Əli-Bayramlı (1938–2008)) — Azərbaycan Respublikasında Şirvan şəhər ərazi vahidi. Azərbaycanda şəhər. 25 aprel 2008-ci il tarixli 594-IIIQ saylı Azərbaycan Respublikasının Qanunu ilə şəhər Şirvan adlandırılmışdır.\nŞirvan 1938–1954-cü illərdə qəsəbə, 28 iyul 1954-cü ildə rayon tabeli şəhər statusu almışdır. 4 yanvar 1963-cü ildən respublika tabeli şəhərdir.\nOnun ərazisi 72.7 km², əhalisinin sayı 87946 nəfər, əhalinin sıxlığı isə hər 1 kv.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Ширва́н (азерб. Şirvan) — город республиканского подчинения в Азербайджанской Республике.\nВ административном подчинении города находятся посёлок Байрамлы (выделен в 2004 г. из состава города), поселок Гаджыкаграманлы.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"Shirvan (Azerbaijani: Şirvan) is a city in Azerbaijan, located on the Kura River. It was called Zubovka until 1938 and Ali Bayramli until 2008. From 1938 to 1954, Shirvan was a village. It was granted city status on January 4, 1963. The territory of Shirvan is 72.7 km2, and the population is 87,400 according to the 2020 census. Population density is 1226 persons per 1 km2. The city also includes the settlement of Hajigarahmanly and Bairamly.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Shirvan_city.jpg/960px-Shirvan_city.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","small":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Shirvan_city.jpg/960px-Shirvan_city.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":800,"height":508,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Shirvan_city.jpg","title":"Shirvan city.jpg","artist":"Ds02006","credit":"Own work","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":null,"source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q241116: Shirvan","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q241116","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Şirvan (şəhər)","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%C5%9Eirvan_(%C5%9F%C9%99h%C9%99r)&oldid=9203483","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C5%9Eirvan_(%C5%9F%C9%99h%C9%99r)","revid":9203483,"revDate":"2026-11-16","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-ru","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"ru","title":"Ширван (Азербайджан)","publisher":"Википедия (на русском)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%D0%A8%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD_(%D0%90%D0%B7%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B1%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%B4%D0%B6%D0%B0%D0%BD)&oldid=154402849","pageUrl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A8%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD_(%D0%90%D0%B7%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B1%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%B4%D0%B6%D0%B0%D0%BD)","revid":154402849,"revDate":"2026-08-12","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-en","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"en","title":"Şirvan, Azerbaijan","publisher":"Wikipedia (English)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%C5%9Eirvan%2C_Azerbaijan&oldid=1378551770","pageUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C5%9Eirvan%2C_Azerbaijan","revid":1378551770,"revDate":"2026-10-05","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"img-1","kind":"commons","title":"File:Shirvan city.jpg","publisher":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Shirvan_city.jpg","licence":"Public domain","retrieved":"2026-11-26"}],"langs":["az","ru","en"],"verification":"sourced"}